# Whitelist: ignore everything, then allow only the command center's code and launchers.
# Keeps out the API key, models, llama.cpp binaries, browser/VS Code profiles, logs and personal state.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!start-llm.bat
!start-standard.bat
!start-uncensored.bat
!check-model.bat
!start-command-center.bat
!start-vscode-laptop.bat
!sync.bat
!command-center/
command-center/*
!command-center/server.py
!command-center/workspaces.py
!command-center/tokens.py
!command-center/chats.py
!command-center/taskbar.py
!command-center/launch.pyw
!command-center/index.html
!command-center/command-center.ico
!command-center/start-command-center.bat

# never, even if someone adds a broader rule above
api-key.txt
**/settings.json
**/tokens.json
**/tokens-log.jsonl
**/edge-profile/
**/chats/
**/*.bak
